{
 "esm": "1.0.0",
 "metadata": {
  "name": "FuelFractionCellWRFFire",
  "description": "Fuel fraction remaining and burning area fraction of one fire-grid cell as computed by fire_behavior's Calc_fuel_left (physics/level_set_mod.F90): the cell is split into a 2x2 submesh (fuel_left_irl = fuel_left_jrl = 2); at the four corners of every subcell the level-set function and the ignition time are bilinearly interpolated from the 3x3 node neighbourhood of the cell (the node values are the cell-centred lfn and tign_g of the cell and its eight neighbours; subcell (1,1) uses nodes (i-1..i, j-1..j) at fractions 1/2..1, subcell (2,1) nodes (i..i+1, j-1..j) at fractions 0..1/2 and so on); each subcell's burning area is the level-set sign fraction (1 - sum lfn/sum|lfn|)/2 (Mandel et al. 2011 Sect. 3.2) and its remaining fuel is area exp(-(time_now - tign_mean)/fuel_time) + (1 - area) with the mean of the four corner times since ignition (zero for unburnt or not-yet-ignited corners); the cell values are the subcell means. The per-step burnt fraction fuel_frac_before - fuel_frac feeds Calc_fire_fluxes. For a cell that is entirely burning with uniform ignition time this is the exact solution of dF/dt = -F/fuel_time (EarthSciModels level_set/fuel_consumption.esm, Mandel eq. 3), exposed as dfuel_frac_dt_burning; for partly burning cells the subgrid integration has no single-ODE equivalent, which is why this component is transcribed rather than reusing FuelConsumption. Tests: cells of the instrumented test7 run at step 20 (real32), rel 1e-5 (abs 1e-7 where a subcell fraction is exactly 0 or 1).",
  "license": "MIT",
  "tags": [
   "wildland_fire",
   "fire_behavior",
   "wrf-fire",
   "level-set",
   "fuel-consumption"
  ],
  "references": [
   {
    "citation": "NCAR Community Fire Behavior Model (fire_behavior), develop @ eb77580, physics/level_set_mod.F90 Calc_fuel_left / Calc_fuel_left_at_grid_point; instrumented fork ctessum-claude/fire_behavior branch earthsciml-instrumented."
   },
   {
    "citation": "Mandel, J., Beezley, J.D., Kochanski, A.K. (2011). Coupled atmosphere-wildland fire modeling with WRF 3.3 and SFIRE 2011. Geosci. Model Dev. 4, 591-610, eq. 3 and Sect. 3.2 (fuel fraction and its subgrid integration).",
    "doi": "10.5194/gmd-4-591-2011"
   }
  ]
 },
 "models": {
  "FuelFractionCellWRFFire": {
   "expression_templates": {
    "bilinear": {
     "params": [
      "a00",
      "a01",
      "a10",
      "a11",
      "tx",
      "ty"
     ],
     "description": "Bilinear interpolation between the four coarse nodes (i2,j2), (i2,j2+1), (i2+1,j2), (i2+1,j2+1) at fractional position (tx, ty).",
     "body": {
      "op": "+",
      "args": [
       {
        "op": "*",
        "args": [
         {
          "op": "-",
          "args": [
           1.0,
           "tx"
          ]
         },
         {
          "op": "-",
          "args": [
           1.0,
           "ty"
          ]
         },
         "a00"
        ]
       },
       {
        "op": "*",
        "args": [
         {
          "op": "-",
          "args": [
           1.0,
           "tx"
          ]
         },
         "ty",
         "a01"
        ]
       },
       {
        "op": "*",
        "args": [
         "tx",
         {
          "op": "-",
          "args": [
           1.0,
           "ty"
          ]
         },
         "a10"
        ]
       },
       {
        "op": "*",
        "args": [
         "tx",
         "ty",
         "a11"
        ]
       }
      ]
     }
    },
    "corner_time_since_ignition": {
     "params": [
      "lfn",
      "tign",
      "time_now"
     ],
     "description": "Minus the time since ignition at a subcell corner, 0 if the corner is unburnt (lfn > 0) or ignites later than time_now (Calc_fuel_left_at_grid_point t00..t11).",
     "body": {
      "op": "ifelse",
      "args": [
       {
        "op": "or",
        "args": [
         {
          "op": ">",
          "args": [
           "lfn",
           0.0
          ]
         },
         {
          "op": ">",
          "args": [
           {
            "op": "-",
            "args": [
             "tign",
             "time_now"
            ]
           },
           0.0
          ]
         }
        ]
       },
       0.0,
       {
        "op": "-",
        "args": [
         "tign",
         "time_now"
        ]
       }
      ]
     }
    },
    "subcell_area": {
     "params": [
      "l00",
      "l01",
      "l10",
      "l11",
      "tiny"
     ],
     "description": "Burning area fraction of a subcell from its corner level-set values: (-sum lfn / max(sum |lfn|, tiny) + 1)/2 clipped to [0, 1].",
     "body": {
      "op": "min",
      "args": [
       1.0,
       {
        "op": "max",
        "args": [
         0.0,
         {
          "op": "/",
          "args": [
           {
            "op": "+",
            "args": [
             {
              "op": "/",
              "args": [
               {
                "op": "-",
                "args": [
                 {
                  "op": "+",
                  "args": [
                   "l00",
                   "l01",
                   "l10",
                   "l11"
                  ]
                 }
                ]
               },
               {
                "op": "max",
                "args": [
                 {
                  "op": "+",
                  "args": [
                   {
                    "op": "abs",
                    "args": [
                     "l00"
                    ]
                   },
                   {
                    "op": "abs",
                    "args": [
                     "l01"
                    ]
                   },
                   {
                    "op": "abs",
                    "args": [
                     "l10"
                    ]
                   },
                   {
                    "op": "abs",
                    "args": [
                     "l11"
                    ]
                   }
                  ]
                 },
                 "tiny"
                ]
               }
              ]
             },
             1.0
            ]
           },
           2.0
          ]
         }
        ]
       }
      ]
     }
    },
    "subcell_fuel_left": {
     "params": [
      "area",
      "ta",
      "fuel_time"
     ],
     "description": "Fuel fraction left in a subcell: area exp(ta/fuel_time) + (1 - area) where the subcell burns, else 1.",
     "body": {
      "op": "ifelse",
      "args": [
       {
        "op": ">",
        "args": [
         "area",
         0.0
        ]
       },
       {
        "op": "+",
        "args": [
         {
          "op": "*",
          "args": [
           "area",
           {
            "op": "exp",
            "args": [
             {
              "op": "/",
              "args": [
               "ta",
               "fuel_time"
              ]
             }
            ]
           }
          ]
         },
         {
          "op": "-",
          "args": [
           1.0,
           "area"
          ]
         }
        ]
       },
       1.0
      ]
     }
    }
   },
